<title>USA: 3M to buy back up to 10 mln more shares.</title>
<headline>3M to buy back up to 10 mln more shares.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minnesota Mining &amp; Manufacturing Co said Tuesday its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 10 million additional shares of the company's stock, bringing the current stock buyback authorization to a total of 20 million shares.</p>
<p>About 5.7 million shares have been purchased under this authorization, which extends through December 31, 1997.</p>
<p>As of March 31, 1997, 3M had 416,244,474 common shares outstanding and about 133,350 shareholders of record.</p>
<p>Shares of 3M closed off 7/8 to 91-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
